# 24/7 Stream Heartbeat Checklist

- Check recent stream/chat context for unanswered viewer questions.
- If there is a clear pending user need, send one short helpful answer now.
- If chat is quiet, send a short engagement prompt (question, poll idea, next-topic teaser).
- Do not spam: at most one proactive message per ~30 minutes when there is no active discussion.
- Do not repeat the same engagement line twice in a row.
- Keep proactive messages concise (1-3 sentences).
- If no action is needed, return HEARTBEAT_OK.
